msgstr ":doc:`namestitveni priročnik <index>`"

#: ../installation/index.rst:15
#: 98c53c22c5bd4509ac151cc55baa9b32
msgid "Installation manual"
msgstr "Priročnik za namestitev"

#: ../installation/index.rst:17
#: 9f5719dafc48455da46a2a7b76a59da0
msgid "Galette installation is quite simple, really :) Just a few graphical steps to follow once the prerequisites are met."
msgstr ""
"Namestitev Galette je pravzaprav precej preprosta :) Ko so izpolnjeni vsi "
"pogoji, je treba slediti le nekaj grafičnim korakom."

#: ../installation/index.rst:19
#: ee8daf9513b8466a9061fcbf20921104
msgid "First, download latest Galette release from official repository:"
msgstr "Najprej prenesite najnovejšo izdajo Galette iz uradnega repozitorija:"

#: ../installation/index.rst:21
#: 4fefadd66b1640f2a2f2f2abb9c60174
msgid "Get latest Galette!"
msgstr "Pridobite najnovejšo Galette!"

#: ../installation/index.rst:25
#: 2fffae07348247e78c442a2150de97cb
msgid "Then, uncompress the archive. If you are running Windows, you will have to install a file archiver software supporting the TAR archive format, such as `7zip <https://www.7-zip.org/>`_. If you are using Linux, run the following commands (adapt the version if needed):"
msgstr ""
"Nato razpakirajte arhiv. Če uporabljate Windows, boste morali namestiti "
"programsko opremo za arhiviranje datotek, ki podpira format arhiva TAR, kot "
"je `7zip <https://www.7-zip.org/>`_. Če uporabljate Linux, zaženite "
"naslednje ukaze (po potrebi prilagodite različico):"

#: ../installation/index.rst:34
#: c7dcfe659e5f485698eacdd2b6a92287
msgid "The current stable version of Galette is |stable_version|. A `nightly archive <https://galette.eu/download/galette-dev.tar.bz2>`_ is build each night from the development branch, and you can also :doc:`retrieve Galette development version  <../source_code>`."
msgstr ""
"Trenutna stabilna različica Galette je |stable_version|. `Nočni arhiv "
"<https://galette.eu/download/galette-dev.tar.bz2>`_ se gradi vsako noč iz "
"razvojne veje, prav tako pa lahko :doc:`pridobite razvojno različico Galette "
"<../source_code>`."

#: ../installation/index.rst:36
#: d9c43edfbbdc4990b13f149fa60bfe1e
msgid "Alternatively, there is a community repository that provide `Galette as a Docker image <https://github.com/galette/docker>`_."
msgstr ""
"Druga možnost je repozitorij skupnosti, ki ponuja `Galette kot sliko Docker "
"<https://github.com/galette/docker>`_."
